                                "sense_id": "49af317c-52d3-32a1-8835-b54ecf05649f",
                                "text": "Cupro-nickel 50-drachma coins were introduced in 1980."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "350d1e69-32f4-483d-be09-4ffca1882dd8",
                                "sense_id": "49af317c-52d3-32a1-8835-b54ecf05649f",
                                "text": "Five drachmae."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4184e7fb-5351-40bd-9a08-824da2238a3b",
                                "sense_id": "49af317c-52d3-32a1-8835-b54ecf05649f",
                                "text": "In 1982, the spelling of the plural of drachma was changed from drachmae (δραχμαί) to drachmas (δραχμές). In 1986, nickel-brass 50-drachma coins were introduced, followed by copper 1- and 2-drachma pieces in 1988 and nickel-brass coins of 20 and 100 drachmas in 1990."
